  "lines": [
    {
      "key": "006ab27",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "أنت شجاع! لكنني ما زلت أفتقد صور عجائب نهرنا.",
      "sourceEnText": "You are brave! But I still miss photos of our river wonders.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_006ab27.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "SENIOR_M",
      "durationMs": 4571,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:52Z",
      "textHash": "3a2901d4f7af1b86ad0f82be1073d6e038e0af07fd94e4564ebc4003d6f5f2e3"
    },
    {
      "key": "0265d07",
      "nodeTitle": "post_quest_activity",
      "sourceText": "ارسم خريطة بسيطة لرحلتك.",
      "sourceEnText": "Draw a simple MAP of your journey.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_0265d07.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2194,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:56Z",
      "textHash": "686d855cc0abceaaa5aea7b31de88b6f7bec34459e67457efc79c58ee5c19e13"
    },
    {
      "key": "02a257c",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "أحسنت!",
      "sourceEnText": "Well done!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_02a257c.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 940,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:03Z",
      "textHash": "639c0b558adeba8422e6202b0b7612aa73b0f4fd97a5e7e0d57fc6956215f093"
    },
    {
      "key": "03ea48b",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "أنت تبلي بلاءً حسناً!",
      "sourceEnText": "You are doing well!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_03ea48b.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "SENIOR_M",
      "durationMs": 2142,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:47Z",
      "textHash": "4eeeaa31743dab02c72770e85c3ac89095dbaa50dcbd90af3c7c9c167aa2e040"
    },
    {
      "key": "0577d80",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_tourist",
      "sourceText": "يوجد في هذه المدينة العديد من الجسور.",
      "sourceEnText": "So many BRIDGES in this city.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_0577d80.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "KID_M",
      "durationMs": 2847,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:58Z",
      "textHash": "b82e796fb27667dc82a2e35e064ffd12baef3fe6603d1a50a315bfbfd18468bd"
    },
    {
      "key": "07ff8c5",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_tourist",
      "sourceText": "أحب البيروجي!",
      "sourceEnText": "I love Pierogi!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_07ff8c5.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "KID_M",
      "durationMs": 1358,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:11:01Z",
      "textHash": "f73688cb042371eb88f9995d2c494948d2a017429dbb092675a09859df99f13e"
    },
    {
      "key": "089ea37",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_tourist",
      "sourceText": "مدينة فروتسواف جميلة حقاً.",
      "sourceEnText": "Wroclaw is really beautiful.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_089ea37.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "KID_M",
      "durationMs": 2612,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:11:00Z",
      "textHash": "799282cc9b122235578f6934804b27576e1bcac64cdcfdcebd56103f3ab49bce"
    },
    {
      "key": "0bfcb05",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "إذا لم تتمكن من العثور عليهم، فاستخدم الخريطة!",
      "sourceEnText": "If you can't find them, use the map!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_0bfcb05.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "SENIOR_M",
      "durationMs": 4101,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:48Z",
      "textHash": "165328e775196782a83bfa734a20e3b70530b90146837085f3c21a863d7477d3"
    },
    {
      "key": "0f36b7f",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_kayak",
      "sourceText": "أريد أن أركب قارب كاياك صغير.",
      "sourceEnText": "I want to ride a small KAYAK.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_0f36b7f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "KID_M",
      "durationMs": 2247,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:53Z",
      "textHash": "6b23e79ee8b828d7e75830f82342d2430ae17f3ee98a0440dd75dd97541ad94e"
    },
    {
      "key": "barge_1",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_barge",
      "sourceText": "لقد نقلت البوارج (باركي) الفحم والرمل على نهر أودرا لقرون.",
      "sourceEnText": "Barges (Barki) have carried coal and sand on the Odra for centuries.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_barge_1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5538,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:42Z",
      "textHash": "dc313aa28369e32be9b7501621c6f025106bf4e7d3e80bea7087afee249a54c7"
    },
    {
      "key": "barge_2",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_barge",
      "sourceText": "البارجة مسطحة للغاية. لماذا؟",
      "sourceEnText": "A barge is very flat. Why?",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_barge_2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4467,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:44Z",
      "textHash": "d655b1916bfee136aac9f6e2cf87f7f45d6a255310fe8ac658cf3544a0f1ab7e"
    },
    {
      "key": "barge_3",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_barge",
      "sourceText": "حمل الأشياء الثقيلة حتى عندما لا يكون الماء عميقاً.",
      "sourceEnText": "To carry heavy things even when the water is not deep.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_barge_3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4336,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:45Z",
      "textHash": "2a7cd6fcd47e3a5efc13235ca2876dbfc673b1b2832e1a6e936f6dc13c5fbb3d"
    },
    {
      "key": "barge_4",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_barge",
      "sourceText": "بالضبط! إنها شاحنة تطفو.",
      "sourceEnText": "Exactly! It's a truck that floats.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_barge_4.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2612,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:47Z",
      "textHash": "2abeee54d80ca847b7b93f450fc6c8e386339b4cfebbffbe908699ff2c9d4290"
    },
    {
      "key": "barge_5",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_barge",
      "sourceText": "حتى يتمكن من الاختباء من الأقزام",
      "sourceEnText": "So it can hide from dwarves",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_barge_5.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2560,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:49Z",
      "textHash": "516dca471816345dd32aac3aad5fe54b5fa2959f43aac94cf3391c79ac6cd1cc"
    },
    {
      "key": "ch_house1",
      "nodeTitle": "chest_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "أصلحوا النوافذ في المنزل العائم!",
      "sourceEnText": "Fix the windows on the floating house!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_ch_house1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2978,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:28Z",
      "textHash": "43b0bd6df1279c0aa1f97bc04471525d697f98804b25d17b77728cc55a08affc"
    },
    {
      "key": "ch_house2",
      "nodeTitle": "chest_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "منزل دافئ على نهر أودرا! تم التقاط الصورة.",
      "sourceEnText": "A cozy home on the Odra! Photo collected.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_ch_house2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3736,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:29Z",
      "textHash": "b6e25be0433f93b70c3045867e99f6f9d89df6069e469189678b26d3251f8923"
    },
    {
      "key": "ch_map1",
      "nodeTitle": "chest_odra_map",
      "sourceText": "أثبت أنك تعرف أين يتدفق النهر!",
      "sourceEnText": "Prove you know where the river flows!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_ch_map1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2847,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:08:51Z",
      "textHash": "8c381fa5fbdb634ac4d3e2cc8147450227c934b9c3eca6f7f3648d75676a6ac7"
    },
    {
      "key": "ch_map2",
      "nodeTitle": "chest_odra_map",
      "sourceText": "عادت الخريطة! إنها تُظهر نهر أودرا وهو يصب في بحر البلطيق.",
      "sourceEnText": "The map is back! It shows the Odra flowing into the Baltic Sea.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_ch_map2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5642,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:08:50Z",
      "textHash": "aa8e62cb096ca3ef0ab6b2dc719ed52f4b94ed951a0e5a1d19d29b1905f7b5c9"
    },
    {
      "key": "ch_redz1",
      "nodeTitle": "chest_redzinski_bridge",
      "sourceText": "أعد بناء أكبر جسر في فروتسواف!",
      "sourceEnText": "Rebuild the biggest bridge in Wrocław!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_ch_redz1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2482,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:07Z",
      "textHash": "422a53e848593aaebca71b8257a0686100763b3a7213c7245500ea4f782f3f4c"
    },
    {
      "key": "ch_sign1",
      "nodeTitle": "chest_river_sign",
      "sourceText": "غطت أنتورا اللافتة بالطين! امسحها لتتمكن من رؤية الأمواج.",
      "sourceEnText": "Antura covered the sign in mud! Wipe it clean to see the waves.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_ch_sign1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5303,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:06Z",
      "textHash": "0f043940e1586ac272c48e4473e06bd48df24d67d2a60ce87b01f76acae866b8"
    },
    {
      "key": "ch_sign2",
      "nodeTitle": "chest_river_sign",
      "sourceText": "عمل رائع! الآن ستعرف دائمًا متى تعبر نهرًا في أوروبا.",
      "sourceEnText": "Great job! Now you'll always know when you're crossing a river in Europe.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_ch_sign2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4859,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:04Z",
      "textHash": "90e2a9d9fc51c929bd8f62a624c7e7117a16e40053c11e97e4374a703db8e8cf"
    },
    {
      "key": "ch_tour1",
      "nodeTitle": "chest_boat_people",
      "sourceText": "ابحث عن السياح المختبئين على سطح السفينة!",
      "sourceEnText": "Find the tourists hidden on the deck!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_ch_tour1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3187,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:41Z",
      "textHash": "33ac49f9fe48dceeabb6b2e1a733da6c12a14e8bddeb19501d2e280ce36b13da"
    },
    {
      "key": "ch_train1",
      "nodeTitle": "chest_bridge_train",
      "sourceText": "قم بتوصيل الصناديق الثقيلة بقضبان السكة الحديدية!",
      "sourceEnText": "Match the heavy boxes to the train tracks!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_ch_train1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4206,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:18Z",
      "textHash": "8e24045b2c7e22a81bd224e954f8348eba90b0c10e8392154e455d0ecaaa254b"
    },
    {
      "key": "ch_tum1",
      "nodeTitle": "chest_tumski_bridge",
      "sourceText": "نظف الصدأ عن هذا الجسر الحديدي القديم!",
      "sourceEnText": "Clean the rust off this old iron bridge!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_ch_tum1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3213,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:08:36Z",
      "textHash": "037073835bb0155b48eec84f354174f65f33de3607adb1a3d35b95972c423129"
    },
    {
      "key": "chest_empty",
      "nodeTitle": "chest_river_sign",
      "sourceText": "الصندوق فارغ.",
      "sourceEnText": "The chest is empty.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_chest_empty.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1306,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:02Z",
      "textHash": "6e5132e25200667248b418f994bb9238eb6b4b56fa6ca3cf2c27d8b04308f493"
    },
    {
      "key": "chest_locked",
      "nodeTitle": "chest_river_sign",
      "sourceText": "الصندوق مغلق.",
      "sourceEnText": "The chest is locked.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_chest_locked.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
