    },
    {
      "key": "end_1",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "لقد تعلمنا عن أنواع مختلفة من الجسور.",
      "sourceEnText": "We learned about different types of bridges.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_end_1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3030,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:01Z",
      "textHash": "29f0e39d72ffaf831e403e8fcf2ce8eff3ec67f89873233cf3ae9715f6eaf449"
    },
    {
      "key": "end_2",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "تعلمنا عن أنواع مختلفة من القوارب.",
      "sourceEnText": "We learned about different types of boats.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_end_2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2900,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:59Z",
      "textHash": "eb669932361a9d1077430d126f8f3a209db644832b8ab410b5d24d8071de9c67"
    },
    {
      "key": "end_3",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "استكشفنا نهر أودرا.",
      "sourceEnText": "We explored the ODRA RIVER.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_end_3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1698,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:58Z",
      "textHash": "f7d8d3f654d07e48b062b895d65695d4a474aa346d560aa849877691dbc0e90f"
    },
    {
      "key": "fail_redz",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_redzinski_bridge",
      "sourceText": "يبدو الأمر وكأنه سحر، ولكنه في الواقع هندسة!",
      "sourceEnText": "It looks like magic, but it's actually engineering!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_fail_redz.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3788,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:08:24Z",
      "textHash": "2c39c1da8f79d1bb352e9b878185b8db78b3ff2b454a9c9c8a946b918341fdaa"
    },
    {
      "key": "fail_tour",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_people",
      "sourceText": "لم نغرق بعد! حاول مرة أخرى.",
      "sourceEnText": "We aren't underwater yet! Try again.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_fail_tour.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2795,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:39Z",
      "textHash": "e92ff9176a90c5d51a59caef15c91ff4ae365285b027d85e3e24785d9f9e303e"
    },
    {
      "key": "fail_train",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_train",
      "sourceText": "إنها صاخبة، ولكن ليس هذا هو السبب!",
      "sourceEnText": "They are loud, but that's not why!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_fail_train.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3135,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:17Z",
      "textHash": "9da7fba279d447bd7332c7010cbfbfd1f7b16473c2c0dda2be50133ab0ae7cb5"
    },
    {
      "key": "fail_tum",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_tumski_bridge",
      "sourceText": "لن يكون ذلك رومانسياً على الإطلاق! حاول مرة أخرى.",
      "sourceEnText": "That would not be very romantic! Try again.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_fail_tum.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4989,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:08:38Z",
      "textHash": "88eda143dbcb40dfd88fffd2ffd540d13d35a00a4344feb4089da2e211434637"
    },
    {
      "key": "found_photos",
      "nodeTitle": "task_find_photos_done",
      "sourceText": "لقد وجدت جميع الصور!",
      "sourceEnText": "You found all the photos!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_found_photos.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "SENIOR_M",
      "durationMs": 2116,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:42Z",
      "textHash": "5964c0b16d5dd1a0e5eb4202050cb2978854dfc2f64fd74b08336e469b45b77e"
    },
    {
      "key": "go_back",
      "nodeTitle": "task_find_photos_done",
      "sourceText": "ارجع وتحدث إلى المرشد.",
      "sourceEnText": "Go back and talk to the guide.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_go_back.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "SENIOR_M",
      "durationMs": 2664,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:40Z",
