    {
      "key": "house_1",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "في فروتسواف، يطلق بعض الناس على النهر اسم \"شارعهم الرئيسي\".",
      "sourceEnText": "In Wrocław, some people call the river their \"home street.\"",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_house_1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4885,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:20Z",
      "textHash": "1e3fa49f690645a671209e9bd9ec2243eba0d9344d3e7b49b26967a281203acf"
    },
    {
      "key": "house_2",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "حتى الأقزام سيحبون منزلًا عائمًا!",
      "sourceEnText": "Even the dwarves would love a floating house!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_house_2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3553,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:22Z",
      "textHash": "74982fd0f9b8cbe87c3228d65c138e14fca372434ba8e17064c5e99166282207"
    },
    {
      "key": "house_3",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "إذا كنت تعيش في منزل عائم، فماذا تستخدم كفناء خلفي؟",
      "sourceEnText": "If you live on a houseboat, what do you use for a backyard?",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_house_3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4049,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:23Z",
      "textHash": "1707e93797b4a04f5b177da987340405e1468f25930d82dc39dd8aa82a3de554"
    },
    {
      "key": "house_4",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "نهر أودرا",
      "sourceEnText": "The River Odra",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_house_4.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 993,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:25Z",
      "textHash": "81bac75956426550879b1f541249cb06421ea4a8b5f8df24cbadeef40e6a9269"
    },
    {
      "key": "house_6",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "غابة على السطح",
      "sourceEnText": "A rooftop forest",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_house_6.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1228,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:26Z",
      "textHash": "666be1f4163c7bf9be7aefdab6e26fab6113b9b430f981d795e55fad7533ff34"
    },
    {
      "key": "kayak_2",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_kayak",
      "sourceText": "تُعد قوارب الكاياك رائعة لاستكشاف الطبيعة!",
      "sourceEnText": "Kayaks are great for exploring nature!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_kayak_2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "KID_M",
      "durationMs": 3448,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:55Z",
      "textHash": "74b5f93830c0bee9f8cbc0016dfcb9cc4513fefe241b874d5053daa0895b1601"
    },
    {
      "key": "kayak_3",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_kayak",
      "sourceText": "التجديف ممتع ورياضة جيدة!",
      "sourceEnText": "Paddling is fun and good exercise!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_kayak_3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "KID_M",
      "durationMs": 2560,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:57Z",
      "textHash": "74d408921c548efba41f3998a8ce73691e2f56fbc2a01cf43ef2d5fd1c08a771"
    },
    {
      "key": "map_1",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_odra_map",
      "sourceText": "نهر أودرا هو ثاني أطول نهر في بولندا.",
      "sourceEnText": "The Odra is Poland's second longest river.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_map_1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3213,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:00Z",
      "textHash": "51faacd361059c9cca6529e286c70d061a8052483c27f050b31483163d4a17d1"
    },
    {
      "key": "map_2",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_odra_map",
      "sourceText": "هل يصب نهر أودرا في الجبال أم في البحر؟",
      "sourceEnText": "Does the Odra flow into the mountains or the sea?",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_map_2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3736,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:08:58Z",
      "textHash": "32f038388c20d7d0b8ab9264fc1678ca62b36625f7ffde697634784eb309b9c0"
    },
    {
      "key": "map_3",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_odra_map",
      "sourceText": "بحر البلطيق",
      "sourceEnText": "The Baltic Sea",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_map_3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1280,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:08:56Z",
      "textHash": "9aa58f963dc793d56cf13a8207b3b1fc24eae0b7fa11db050adb43193814390b"
    },
    {
      "key": "map_4",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_odra_map",
      "sourceText": "صحيح! إنه يتدفق حتى الشمال.",
      "sourceEnText": "Correct! It flows all the way to the north.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_map_4.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2847,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:08:55Z",
      "textHash": "0fddf7bd74a19b9a0b7ee855eb615e0a8dc3407664e10c1112ff7e939a409c5c"
    },
    {
      "key": "map_5",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_odra_map",
      "sourceText": "البحر الأبيض المتوسط",
      "sourceEnText": "The Mediterranean Sea",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_map_5.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1959,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:08:53Z",
      "textHash": "63b61d13fbb51e19d158a6b8f2b45d4881af51e60475c20b5b96056f33c6dc59"
    },
    {
      "key": "prot_1",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "دزيكوجي! لقد وجدت كل صوري!",
      "sourceEnText": "Dziękuję! You found all my photos!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_prot_1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "SENIOR_M",
      "durationMs": 2795,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:55Z",
      "textHash": "b8660eecd8a34dfec6df38a5690ef8dc23f4b022fafcbdecf144b5a322315ecd"
    },
    {
      "key": "prot_2",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "الآن يمكنني مواصلة الزيارة. سؤال أخير...",
      "sourceEnText": "Now I can continue the visit. One last question...",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_prot_2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "SENIOR_M",
      "durationMs": 3265,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:53Z",
      "textHash": "f7c559ee81fd0c8bf51e0d77d50935b7d9752d9d9f0ef434fe9d6208456efede"
    },
    {
      "key": "prot_4",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "ابحثوا عن الصناديق! الناس الذين يقفون بجانب النهر يراقبونها.",
      "sourceEnText": "Look for the chests! The people by the river watch over them.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_prot_4.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "SENIOR_M",
      "durationMs": 5460,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:50Z",
      "textHash": "1c8b3dc68dbba0a52b83fd6262ac9fda07cac5ca1242438f3033e1c32e7e1310"
    },
    {
      "key": "prot_5",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "النجدة! ظنت أنتورا أن دليلي لمدينة فروتسواف كان عظمة!",
      "sourceEnText": "Help! Antura thought my Wrocław Guide was a bone!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_prot_5.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "SENIOR_M",
      "durationMs": 5642,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:45Z",
      "textHash": "9e16187fa729c9cc897e1471bd7f9326c67f45388012da9e61de22fa91e145e7"
    },
    {
      "key": "prot_6",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "الصفحات مفقودة. هل يمكنك العثور عليها؟",
      "sourceEnText": "The pages are lost around. Can you find them?",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_prot_6.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "SENIOR_M",
      "durationMs": 3213,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:44Z",
      "textHash": "df4b82875fe7ca34f4fa3d638626c0fdd3530817ac914afe202c015150754d72"
    },
    {
      "key": "quiz1_fail1",
      "nodeTitle": "final_quiz",
      "sourceText": "همم... هذا أبعد من اللازم جنوباً!",
      "sourceEnText": "Hmm... that's much too far south!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_quiz1_fail1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3265,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:33Z",
      "textHash": "5f54f1ab623323ad18180ee7b81b15585d13fa3a143f961b07d09473c265e91d"
    },
    {
      "key": "quiz1_fail2",
      "nodeTitle": "final_quiz",
      "sourceText": "ليس تماماً. نهر أودرا يتجه شمالاً، وليس جنوباً!",
      "sourceEnText": "Not quite. The Odra heads North, not South!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_quiz1_fail2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4624,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:30Z",
      "textHash": "64bf1ee926767ff853b71cfde7102af57b44f2d4dc817aa019db3370d2e53f2a"
    },
    {
      "key": "quiz1_hint",
      "nodeTitle": "final_quiz",
      "sourceText": "لا داعي للقلق! انظر إلى الخط الأزرق على الخريطة.",
      "sourceEnText": "No worries! Look at the blue line on the map.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_quiz1_hint.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4989,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:27Z",
      "textHash": "fe900adf72d09eb4d8dfdcc1384b439ff4b89fd08f187d13f4dc8304b8bf981c"
    },
    {
      "key": "quiz1_intro",
      "nodeTitle": "final_quiz",
      "sourceText": "نهر أودرا نهر طويل. هل تتذكر أين ينتهي المطاف بكل تلك المياه؟",
      "sourceEnText": "The Odra is a long river. Do you remember where all that water ends up?",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_quiz1_intro.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5590,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:39Z",
      "textHash": "3e04522030d90f38c25f9825cfbc834220a252405ffc051a2c7d2422cf9f97f1"
    },
    {
      "key": "quiz1_ok",
      "nodeTitle": "final_quiz",
      "sourceText": "صحيح! يتدفق نهر أودرا شمالاً عبر بولندا ويصب في بحر البلطيق.",
      "sourceEnText": "Tak! Correct! The Odra flows north across Poland and into the Baltic Sea.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_quiz1_ok.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 6896,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:36Z",
      "textHash": "d5bc508555f439b50a829ab039449347a5d722a1c168b25aa688f603d159b400"
    },
    {
      "key": "quiz2_a1",
      "nodeTitle": "final_quiz_2",
      "sourceText": "لا، نهر فيسلا أطول",
      "sourceEnText": "No, the Wisła is longer",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_quiz2_a1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2142,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:23Z",
      "textHash": "078595bc6baedbc98fb7d4adced3b79884a71da11b2bb55bc5db4ae7e7258496"
    },
    {
      "key": "quiz2_a2",
      "nodeTitle": "final_quiz_2",
      "sourceText": "نعم، إنها الأطول",
      "sourceEnText": "Yes, it is the longest",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_quiz2_a2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1646,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:20Z",
      "textHash": "0e0ce4c21d8dd7770928b3de288b8a2d1b9b4063a7ab9ffdb32519ed48526f56"
    },
    {
      "key": "quiz2_fail",
      "nodeTitle": "final_quiz_2",
      "sourceText": "إنه كبير جداً، ولكن هناك نهر واحد أطول منه.",
      "sourceEnText": "It is very big, but there is one river that is even longer.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_quiz2_fail.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3605,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:18Z",
      "textHash": "914b1595f1b52bc81c65fe10581e5f7f76600fe68ad47cce5c5e1f2ba527542f"
    },
    {
      "key": "quiz2_intro",
      "nodeTitle": "final_quiz_2",
      "sourceText": "هل نهر أودرا هو أطول نهر في بولندا؟",
      "sourceEnText": "Is Odra the longest river in Poland?",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_quiz2_intro.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2795,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:25Z",
      "textHash": "fbf83fb6d4ddc98d03addd163264fb26751623f9777ddd432ed175b2b46c1910"
    },
    {
      "key": "quiz2_ok",
      "nodeTitle": "final_quiz_2",
      "sourceText": "ممتاز! نهر فيسلا هو الأطول، ونهر أودرا هو الأطول في المرتبة الثانية.",
      "sourceEnText": "Perfect! The Wisła is number one, Odra is the second longest.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_quiz2_ok.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5904,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:22Z",
      "textHash": "4600c7760ab3476b684edf80c996d6e8e57edce69d8cfcae9f3eca32ea55b2b3"
    },
    {
      "key": "quiz_a1",
      "nodeTitle": "final_quiz",
      "sourceText": "بحر البلطيق",
      "sourceEnText": "The Baltic Sea",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_quiz_a1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1280,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:37Z",
      "textHash": "9aa58f963dc793d56cf13a8207b3b1fc24eae0b7fa11db050adb43193814390b"
    },
    {
      "key": "quiz_a2",
      "nodeTitle": "final_quiz",
      "sourceText": "البحر الأبيض المتوسط",
      "sourceEnText": "The Mediterranean Sea",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_quiz_a2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1933,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:34Z",
      "textHash": "63b61d13fbb51e19d158a6b8f2b45d4881af51e60475c20b5b96056f33c6dc59"
    },
    {
      "key": "quiz_a3",
      "nodeTitle": "final_quiz",
      "sourceText": "البحر الأسود",
      "sourceEnText": "The Black Sea",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_quiz_a3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1228,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:31Z",
      "textHash": "58903a543d95df510430cacd815880e74cc41ad9169edcfdc318b1c41115ae28"
    },
    {
      "key": "redz_1",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_redzinski_bridge",
      "sourceText": "جسر ريدزينسكي هو الأعلى والأطول في بولندا.",
      "sourceEnText": "The Rędziński Bridge is the tallest and longest in Poland.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_redz_1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3187,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:08:35Z",
      "textHash": "009c1ecdddedc222a6a050b6da29af8d3708d6acbdbd1fd9a2cb094585842bc9"
    },
    {
      "key": "redz_2",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_redzinski_bridge",
      "sourceText": "يبلغ ارتفاعه 122 متراً. أعلى من الكاتدرائية!",
      "sourceEnText": "It is 122 meters tall. Higher than the Cathedral!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_redz_2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4989,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:08:33Z",
      "textHash": "3ddceba158af5514a8de9dc70db411fdcfb47b81c19ed824d213026aa3001838"
    },
    {
      "key": "redz_3",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_redzinski_bridge",
      "sourceText": "ما الذي يدعم هذا الجسر الضخم؟",
      "sourceEnText": "What holds this massive bridge up?",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_redz_3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2116,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:08:31Z",
      "textHash": "0286e716d67f587856a80c23cffe59229e1551a3f960ef49cda5e8d1c143d803"
    },
    {
      "key": "redz_4",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_redzinski_bridge",
      "sourceText": "كابلات فولاذية",
      "sourceEnText": "Steel cables",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_redz_4.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1411,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:08:30Z",
      "textHash": "9118d213fd3647a110dc4299d9af6061bfd457621a7887f07df219f4f0bf32c4"
    },
    {
      "key": "redz_5",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_redzinski_bridge",
      "sourceText": "صحيح! حبال متينة تدعم هذا الجسر العملاق. تستخدمه السيارات للتنقل في أنحاء المدينة.",
      "sourceEnText": "Correct! Strong ropes hold this giant bridge. Cars use it to drive around the city.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_redz_5.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 7863,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:08:28Z",
      "textHash": "4b8c5fcd75bae1a4b40c4c0c566fbae69324ff0d9f15e9cf7433ac0627cb1f0d"
    },
    {
      "key": "redz_6",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_redzinski_bridge",
      "sourceText": "المغناطيس والسحر",
      "sourceEnText": "Magnets and Magic",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_redz_6.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1593,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:08:26Z",
      "textHash": "668c9e0ba0a3073e9a0cb8b86c9ed8aba2df5d885eab1c53255f3e9521cb4bc9"
    },
    {
      "key": "sign_1",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_river_sign",
      "sourceText": "انظر إلى اللافتة الزرقاء الكبيرة بالقرب من الجسر.",
      "sourceEnText": "Look at the big blue sign near the bridge.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_sign_1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3370,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:17Z",
      "textHash": "7df609b6c3e35d636df21f82a4612343688f5e2c3e3dcc17d61fa5aa9ea1b261"
    },
    {
      "key": "sign_3",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_river_sign",
      "sourceText": "ماذا تخبرنا الخطوط البيضاء المتموجة؟",
      "sourceEnText": "What do the white wavy lines tell us?",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_sign_3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3082,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:15Z",
      "textHash": "c528f7e65d6c6aebcca64982aef9cb880fc01d7fcd09148db0fc54ae795667db"
    },
    {
      "key": "sign_4",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_river_sign",
      "sourceText": "يوجد نهر يتدفق هنا",
      "sourceEnText": "There is a river flowing here",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_sign_4.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1698,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:14Z",
      "textHash": "2f38fe1f934d4625381655b07732aa674231d8bbcfbbeac82fa6b54837568305"
    },
    {
      "key": "sign_5",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_river_sign",
      "sourceText": "تاك! تلك الأمواج الزرقاء هي العلامة العالمية للنهر.",
      "sourceEnText": "Tak! Those blue waves are the universal sign for a river.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_sign_5.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 8281,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:12Z",
      "textHash": "c19f787ab08394dd90f94e39676a9c633f842bf9424a81dc034759e9e9d15d32"
    },
    {
      "key": "sign_6",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_river_sign",
      "sourceText": "هناك تحركات للجسر",
      "sourceEnText": "There bridge moves",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_sign_6.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1724,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:10Z",
      "textHash": "adfb32221f07e16bacaf213c4d85c17ac6337601078c151ad83e21bb764208e4"
    },
    {
      "key": "start_1",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_start",
      "sourceText": "نحن في فروتسواف، \"مدينة المئة جسر\".",
      "sourceEnText": "We are in Wrocław, the \"City of a Hundred Bridges\".",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_start_1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3030,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:06Z",
      "textHash": "116b549b6d00913dc182fc75d5b4dae83f625f19955561e2777fd9127b554033"
    },
    {
      "key": "start_2",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_start",
      "sourceText": "سنستكشف اليوم النهر والجسور والقوارب.",
      "sourceEnText": "Today we will explore the river, bridges and boats.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_start_2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3265,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:04Z",
      "textHash": "b2313218cfe3dd5348d759e220abe5171d3d9fde5d4a130f33a48d9e8fcece93"
    },
    {
      "key": "tour_1",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_people",
      "sourceText": "تنقل القوارب السياحية الناس لمشاهدة حديقة الحيوان والكاتدرائية.",
      "sourceEnText": "Tourist boats take people to see the Zoo and the Cathedral.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_tour_1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5068,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:31Z",
      "textHash": "e82c61811c7c6f1f91a3f8b5ff3dd9dc2807d7e3cd4132f5f0b1b7e2c3c67658"
    },
    {
      "key": "tour_2",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_people",
      "sourceText": "ما الذي يستخدمه الناس على متن هذه القوارب لمشاهدة المعالم السياحية؟",
      "sourceEnText": "What do the people on these boats use to see the sights?",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_tour_2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5303,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:33Z",
      "textHash": "2262a8b930e04277428bd89369390839a4c6da9a3aa026703ef7c6c3ef917dcd"
    },
    {
      "key": "tour_3",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_people",
      "sourceText": "عيونهم وكاميراتهم",
      "sourceEnText": "Their eyes and cameras",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_tour_3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1411,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:34Z",
      "textHash": "677fb3647a934b5accee462a1f311de7c9c47cf2f594ae743bc3f8f2ca7c6adf"
    },
    {
      "key": "tour_4",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_people",
      "sourceText": "نعم! ابتسم للصورة!",
      "sourceEnText": "Yes! Smile for the photo!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_tour_4.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2142,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:36Z",
      "textHash": "0bd544432fb4e8d0fbbc64eec67adfcdaae7fda8e4a7e9a09059f89b17387ecf"
    },
    {
      "key": "tour_5",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_people",
      "sourceText": "منظار غواصة",
      "sourceEnText": "A periscope",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_tour_5.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1515,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:37Z",
      "textHash": "6b5a379a39575ae489cebcd0021b3d9424607c206fffaf979ba7a93fba5660a7"
    },
    {
      "key": "tourist_4",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_tourist",
      "sourceText": "جزيرة الكاتدرائية ساحرة في الليل.",
      "sourceEnText": "The Cathedral island is magical at night.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_tourist_4.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "KID_M",
      "durationMs": 2664,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:11:03Z",
      "textHash": "85324fae49e83efab0892577641aeeca8d54d682331c028c7883b8083642658e"
    },
    {
      "key": "train_1",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_train",
      "sourceText": "تعبر القطارات نهر أودرا في فروتسواف منذ أكثر من 150 عامًا.",
      "sourceEnText": "Trains have been crossing the Odra in Wrocław for over 150 years.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_train_1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4937,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:09Z",
      "textHash": "a848d238302bd05802dadd6d0cad1c01404f3e257c0f19ab712b6c37c3614a41"
    },
    {
      "key": "train_2",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_train",
      "sourceText": "لماذا تُصنع جسور القطارات من هذا الفولاذ الثقيل؟",
      "sourceEnText": "Why are train bridges made of such heavy steel?",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_train_2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3500,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:11Z",
      "textHash": "ced3ac6d78ff8e16f71135d5454b3e16731ff86b8f3d1286a579d5e8cfcad7a3"
    },
    {
      "key": "train_3",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_train",
      "sourceText": "لأن القطارات ثقيلة جداً",
      "sourceEnText": "Because trains are very heavy",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_train_3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2142,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:12Z",
      "textHash": "0549432d8e29f5a5abfa3b45f5a782662ebd5f4f6a89b041c76cbe055aad4ba6"
    },
    {
      "key": "train_4",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_train",
      "sourceText": "نعم! يجب أن يكون قوياً بما يكفي لتحمل القطارات الثقيلة.",
      "sourceEnText": "Yes! It must be strong enough for the heavy trains.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_train_4.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4650,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:14Z",
      "textHash": "d32ad522b8fdcc41227ae7fc72169feb9fdeb791dc48638d272cf6125a9de0de"
    },
    {
      "key": "train_5",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_train",
      "sourceText": "لإصدار صوت عالٍ",
      "sourceEnText": "To make a loud noise",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_train_5.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1593,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:10:15Z",
      "textHash": "5337e86b8267e4b96ebd48c7434a29800941e1e7c36b27d3bc51878fa978093c"
    },
    {
      "key": "try_again",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_river_sign",
      "sourceText": "لا. حاول مرة أخرى.",
      "sourceEnText": "No. Try again.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_try_again.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2247,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:09:09Z",
      "textHash": "1afb9085b0938ea463167062aaa9ce703078eefc064b60975ed37f2c737ab447"
    },
    {
      "key": "tum_1",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_tumski_bridge",
      "sourceText": "هذا هو جسر تومسكي. وهو يؤدي إلى أقدم جزء من المدينة.",
      "sourceEnText": "This is the Tumski Bridge. It goes to the oldest part of the city.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_tum_1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5721,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:08:48Z",
      "textHash": "33b58c241e5e9b20ef7267234038ce1a69d1eda7397750c4f3ad0c3e7fffa844"
    },
    {
      "key": "tum_2",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_tumski_bridge",
      "sourceText": "كل مساء، يقوم رجل بإشعال 102 مصباح غاز يدوياً!",
      "sourceEnText": "Every evening, a man lights the 102 gas lanterns here by hand!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_tum_2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 8202,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:08:46Z",
      "textHash": "2dc83f1dddee3befcbac1f8bbd28496d19dac06d36751570d5c3b41be0371509"
    },
    {
      "key": "tum_3",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_tumski_bridge",
      "sourceText": "ما الذي يعلقه الأزواج على هذا الجسر لجلب الحظ والحب؟",
      "sourceEnText": "What do couples hang on this bridge for luck and love?",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_tum_3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4807,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:08:44Z",
      "textHash": "29d63400221ff3a46093780164b4206057517e6c991ae9b3f91510a41a859109"
    },
    {
      "key": "tum_4",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_tumski_bridge",
      "sourceText": "أقفال",
      "sourceEnText": "Padlocks",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_tum_4.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 888,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:08:43Z",
      "textHash": "bdd5e47e7208ff4ebeb87fa15b3fce2cafb0855fc4bd0f440c2cff706a3f355c"
    },
    {
      "key": "tum_5",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_tumski_bridge",
      "sourceText": "نعم! مع أنها ثقيلة جداً وسيتم إزالتها!",
      "sourceEnText": "Yes! Though they are very heavy and will be removed!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_tum_5.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3788,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:08:41Z",
      "textHash": "f4438be4427e5aec25536585e8b9d27222f93b65e66e1304c98eec8faacf34e9"
    },
    {
      "key": "tum_6",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_tumski_bridge",
      "sourceText": "جوارب مبللة",
      "sourceEnText": "Wet socks",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_tum_6.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1306,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:08:40Z",
      "textHash": "786dbd79e5fa6bc9bf8cb60d2150f5870aa0fc1a25e95811e661e8836630ff5d"
    },
    {
      "key": "yes_chest",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_river_sign",
      "sourceText": "الآن يمكنك فتح ذلك الصندوق!",
      "sourceEnText": "Now you can open that chest!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_yes_chest.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "haytham",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2560,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:11:04Z",
